1
00:00:00,449 --> 00:00:04,176
So when using HTMX, we can use hx-on to

2
00:00:04,272 --> 00:00:06,585
listen to events and execute our own

3
00:00:06,681 --> 00:00:07,790
JavaScript code.

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,645
And here I wrote that code inline because as

5
00:00:11,677 --> 00:00:14,712
mentioned, that's indeed recommended, but we

6
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:16,929
could also put this into a separate file,

